<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ title or site.name }} - 十一课件</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ description or site.description }}">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:locale" content="zh_CN">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ title or site.name }}">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ description or site.description }}">
<meta property="og:url" content="{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ site.name }}">
<link rel="icon" href="/assets/avatar.webp" type="image/webp">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css">
{% if lesson and not lesson.seoReady %}<meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow">{% endif %}
{% if lesson %}<script type="application/ld+json">{{ lesson.schema | json | safe }}</script>{% elif unit %}<script type="application/ld+json">{{ unit.schema | json | safe }}</script>{% endif %}
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">跳至正文</a>
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="top-inner">
    <a class="logo" href="/"><img src="/assets/avatar.webp" width="38" height="38" alt="">十一课件</a>
    <nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="/">首页</a><a href="/textbooks/bsd/">北师大版</a><a href="/courses/">课件展厅</a><a href="/articles/">教学文章</a><a href="/about/">关于我</a></nav>
  </div>
</header>
<main class="container" id="main">{{ content | safe }}</main>
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-inner"><strong>十一课件 · 让数学课动起来</strong>
  <p>面向小学数学教师的教材导航、备课思路与原创交互课件。</p>
  <p><a href="/textbooks/bsd/">北师大版教材目录</a> · <a href="/about/">关于创作者</a> · <a href="{{ site.social.xiaohongshu }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">小红书主页</a></p>
  <small>本网站为独立原创教学参考平台，非教材出版社官方网站。不同教材修订版次可能调整章节；购买资源请以实际发布页面为准。</small></div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
